 b7.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Guided by the exhibiting artists\, this tour visits two new ar
 tworks shaped by CityPlace’s layered histories and rhythms. Experience t
 he inaugural Step-Up Series mural which threads vivid colour and narrative
  into the architecture of West Block\, and celebrate Staging Ground’s fi
 nal chapter\, evoking our place in a collective urban ecology.\nJoin us on
  a walking tour beneath the Gardiner Expressway to experience two vibrant 
 new public artworks\, Anahita Akhavan’s multidimensional mural مجلس 
 Majles / Sitting Room at West Block and Stanzie Tooth’s large-scale inst
 allation A Persistent Crossing at Bentway Staging Grounds.
LOCATION:The Bentway Studio
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/artist-talk-neighbourhood-walk-at-the-be
 ntway-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:A Sculpting Class by Artbox
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260509T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260509T140000
UID:blogto-234076@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/04/22/original_imagea1dd61cc-14bd-46df-86c2-cbac98bad7
 18.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Join us at Artbox for a hands-on Sculpting Workshop designed t
 o connect you to your creativity while offering a fun\, relaxing escape.\n
 Settle into a calming atmosphere with a thoughtfully curated playlist as o
 ur experienced instructor guides you step by step through hand-building te
 chniques and essential tools. Create a functional and/or decorative clay p
 iece such as a catch-all tray\, pen holder\, glasses holder\, and so much 
 more—each piece uniquely yours.\nWhat’s Included:\n• Guided instruct
 ion with personalized tips\n• High-quality sculpting tools\, no-bake cla
 y\, apron\, and all supplies\n• Relaxing studio ambiance\n• Snacks and
  refreshments included\nOptional Finishing Kit:\nAdd a finishing kit to re
