DESCRIPTION:Rising pop star Mima has quit singing to pursue a career as an
  actress and model\, but her fans aren’t ready to see her go… Encourag
 ed by her managers\, Mima takes on a recurring role on a popular TV show\,
  when suddenly her handlers and collaborators begin turning up murdered. H
 arboring feelings of guilt and haunted by visions of her former self\, Mim
 a’s reality and fantasy meld into a frenzied paranoia. As her stalker cl
 oses in\, in person and online\, the threat he poses is more real than eve
 n Mima knows\, in this iconic psychological thriller that has frequently b
 een hailed as one of the most important animated films of all time.\nThe d
 ebut film from legendary director Satoshi Kon (Paprika) has frequently bee
 n hailed as one of the most important animated films of all time – an in
 tense psychological thriller for the social media era.
