 14.jpg
DESCRIPTION:For 25 years\, Meagan Bebenek Foundation has been a beacon of 
 hope for families facing the unimaginable: a childhood brain tumour diagno
 sis. And for 25 years\, our community has united around the most powerful 
 symbol of our mission - The HUG.\nThis year\, we celebrate 25 years of com
 munity\, compassion\, and unwavering hope - and you're invited to be part 
 of this milestone moment.\nJoin us as we kick off at De La Salle College\,
  walk through downtown Toronto\, and wrap our arms around SickKids in one 
 power HUG!
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/meagans-walk-hug-toronto-2/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
