BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mothers Day Baby Art Workshop in Toronto
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260509T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260509T113000
UID:blogto-234378@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/04/29/original_imagef6faa626-9b3f-427f-b20f-5934c12373
 f6.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Mother’s Day Baby Art Workshop in Toronto\nA Creative Aftern
 oon Out for Moms and Babies\nLooking for a meaningful way to celebrate Mot
 her’s Day with your little one?\nJoin us at Fresh Paint Studio for a spe
 cial Mother’s Day Baby Art Workshop\, a warm and welcoming creative sess
 ion designed for moms\, babies\, and little ones to enjoy together. This i
 s more than an art workshop — it is a chance for new moms to get out of 
 the house\, enjoy some connection\, meet other moms\, and make beautiful k
 eepsake artwork with their babies just in time for Mother’s Day.\nIn thi
 s special session\, babies will explore colour\, texture\, and movement us
 ing non-toxic vegetable- and fruit-based paints\, along with sponges\, sta
 mps\, and playful mark-making tools. With your help\, your baby will add a
 dorable handprint and footprints to their masterpieces while enjoying a fu
 n\, sensory-rich creative experience.\nIt is the perfect way to slow down\
 , make memories\, and create something heartfelt that can be treasured for
  years to come — whether for yourself\, for baby\, or as a meaningful Mo
 ther’s Day gift for a grandmother or loved one.\nWhat Babies Will Create
 \nBabies can create:\nTwo mini 8 x 10 canvases\nThese keepsake paintings a
 re perfect for preserving those tiny hands and feet in a way that feels pe
 rsonal\, creative\, and full of love.\nPersonalization Option\nWant to mak
 e your baby’s artwork even more special?\nWe can pre-apply your baby’s
  first initial or first and last initial in vinyl lettering to one or two 
 canvases in advance. Your baby will then paint the canvas and once we remo
 ve the vinyl stickers\, the initials will still be visible.\nPlease email 
 your baby’s initial(s) at least three days before the session to:\ninfo@
 freshpaintstudio.ca\nWorkshop Details\nMother’s Day Baby Art Workshop\nD
 ate: May 9\nTime: 10:30 am - 11:30 am\nCost: $40 + HST\nWhy Moms Will Love
  This Workshop\nA beautiful Mother’s Day season outing with baby\nA chan
 ce to socialize and connect with other new moms\nA fun\, baby-friendly sen
 sory art experience\nMeaningful keepsake artwork to cherish\nA relaxed and
  welcoming studio environment\nA special way to celebrate motherhood throu
 gh creativity\nImportant Notes\nWe will be using natural veggie-and fruit-
 based paint made with flour and natural dyes from ingredients such as blue
 berries\, carrots\, beets\, and spinach\, along with food colouring to int
 ensify the colours.\nThis is a messy workshop — and that is part of the 
 fun!\nPlease dress for mess\nWe recommend bringing:\nA change of clothes f
 or baby\nA towel\nAnything your little one may need after clean-up\nAdult 
 smocks are available for caregivers.\nStroller Note\nPlease note that stud
 io space for strollers is limited. If possible\, we recommend bringing a b
 aby carrier or a small compact stroller to help us keep the space comforta
 ble for everyone.\nCelebrate Motherhood in a Meaningful Way\nMother’s Da
 y is not only about gifts — it is about moments. This workshop offers a 
 beautiful opportunity to celebrate the early days of motherhood\, connect 
 with other moms\, and create a keepsake that captures this season in such 
 a special way.\nCome make a mess\, make memories\, and create something be
 autiful with your baby.\nSpaces are limited. Register today.
LOCATION:Fresh Paint Studio + Cafe
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/mothers-day-baby-art-workshop-in-toronto
 -toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
