 kes place on a colourful Greek island with young bride-to-be\, Sophie (pla
 yed by Amanda Seyfriend)\, trying to find her biological Dad. After a bit 
 of sleuthing\, she sends letters to the three different men who she thinks
  could be the one (Pierce Brosnan\, Colin Firth and Stellan Skarsgård)\, 
