 c5.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Mother’s Day Paint Night in Scarborough: Connecting Canvases
  & Truffles\nLooking for a meaningful way to celebrate Mother’s Day in S
 carborough?\nThis Mother’s Day\, gather the people you love and join us 
 at Fresh Paint Studio + Café for a warm\, creative\, and memorable Mother
 ’s Day Paint Night in Scarborough. Our special Connecting Canvases & Tru
 ffles event is designed for moms\, children\, families\, and loved ones wh
 o want to spend quality time together while creating something beautiful.\
 nInstead of another traditional gift\, give Mom an experience she will rem
 ember.\nCreate Together. Connect Together. Celebrate Mom.\nOur Mother’s 
 Day Connecting Canvas Paint Night is more than a traditional painting clas
 s. It is a shared creative experience where each participant paints togeth
 er and when the canvases are placed side by side\, they connect to create 
 one beautiful finished piece.\nFamilies can choose from two\, three\, or f
 our connecting canvases\, making this the perfect Mother’s Day activity 
 for moms and children\, grandmothers and grandchildren\, sisters\, aunties
 \, or anyone who wants to celebrate the mother figure in their life.\nNo p
 ainting experience is needed. One of our professional Fresh Paint Studio a
 rtists will guide you step-by-step\, making the experience beginner-friend
 ly\, relaxed\, and fun for all ages.\nA Sweet Mother’s Day Experience\nT
 o make the afternoon even more special\, this creative session includes co
 mplimentary truffles for participants to enjoy.\nIt is the perfect blend o
 f creativity\, connection\, and a little sweetness — exactly what Mother
 ’s Day should feel like.\nEvent Details\nEvent: Mother’s Day Paint Nig
 ht in Scarborough – Connecting Canvases & Truffles\nDate: Sunday\, May 1
 0\nTime: 1:00 PM – 2:30 PM\nLocation: Fresh Paint Studio + Café\, Scarb
 orough\nAges: 6+\nExperience Level: Beginner-friendly\nIncludes: All paint
 ing materials\, smocks\, professional instruction\, and complimentary truf
 fles\nPricing\n$99 + HST — for 2 painters\nIncludes two connecting 11x14
  canvases\n$144 + HST — for 3 painters\nIncludes three connecting 11x14 
 canvases\n$184 + HST — for a family of 4 painters\nIncludes four connect
 ing 11x14 canvases\nWhy Families Love Fresh Paint Studio for Mother’s Da
 y\nAt Fresh Paint Studio\, we believe that the creative journey matters ju
 st as much as the finished artwork. Our studio is warm\, welcoming\, and d
 esigned to help guests feel comfortable\, even if they have never painted 
 before.\nThis Mother’s Day event is perfect for families looking for:\nM
 other’s Day activities in Scarborough\nA family-friendly paint night in 
 Toronto\nA creative Mother’s Day experience\nA unique gift for Mom\nA be
 ginner-friendly painting event\nA special afternoon with kids\, parents\, 
 and grandparents\nA meaningful alternative to brunch or flowers\nInstead o
 f giving Mom something that will be gone in a day\, create a keepsake toge
 ther that can be remembered for years.\nReserve Your Spot Today\nSpaces fo
 r our Mother’s Day Paint Night in Scarborough are very limited\, and thi
 s event is expected to fill quickly.\nJoin us for an afternoon of painting
 \, connection\, truffles\, and beautiful Mother’s Day memories.\nRegiste
 r today and celebrate Mom with creativity.\nPlease note: Event bookings ar
 e non-refundable. However\, bookings are transferable to another date for 
 a future event.
LOCATION:Fresh Paint Studio + Cafe
