 4c.jpg
DESCRIPTION:THE BEST PUB CRAWL IN TORONTO\nAwarded the Badge of Excellence
  from TripAdvisor as the best pub crawl in the city 🏅\nFeatured on Blog
 TO as one of the best ways to meet people in Toronto 🤩\nand…\nParty i
 n the funnest spots in the city! 🍻🥂\nParty with fun people! 😍😍
 😍\nWe're headed to 3 really fun amazing spots in the Entertainment Dist
 rict of Toronto and trust us\, you will be very entertained as part of the
  pub crawl! See you there!\nMEETING POINT\nThai Tavern\, 221 Richmond St W
 .\nWhen you get to the bar\, ask a server where the pub crawl is (i.e. us)
  and they will direct you.\nPARTY AGENDA\n➡️ 9pm-10pm- Mingling with t
 he Pub Crawl at our first bar of the night! Plus\, get drink deals exclusi
 ve to Pub Crawl Toronto guests!\n➡️ 10pm-11pm- Fun times at the 2nd st
 op of the night with yet more drink deals exclusive to Pub Crawl Toronto g
 uests!\n➡️ 11pm-Close- Party the rest of the night away at our 3rd and
  final stop of the night\, a nightclub to dance the night away to awesome 
 music! Plus\, Pub Crawl Toronto guests get FREE ENTRY to the club too! Nic
 e!\nHOW WE’RE DIFFERENT (And the best\, in our opinion! 😀😀)\n➡
 ️ Our prices will not increase between now and the pub crawl\n➡️ Rea
 l drink specials exclusive to Pub Crawl Toronto- these are deals you won't
  get without a ticket to the crawl!\n➡️ We don’t ditch pub crawlers 
 at the door of the first stop of the night. Our host will be guiding the c
 rawl throughout\, to help ensure everyone has an amazing time!\n➡️ Eve
 ryone moves together on the crawl\, making it a great and easy way to meet
  everyone!\n➡️ Every bar/club we are going to is less than 5 mins walk
 ing from the next one making things super easy for you!\nSee you there!!\n
 LOGISTICAL DETAILS\n➡️ There is a dress code- No ballcaps\, sweatshirt
 s\, jerseys\, sweatpants\, ripped jeans\, baggy cargo pants or running sho
 es. If you don't get into the bars/clubs we go to\, the pub crawl is not r
 esponsible for you!\n➡️ The club we are going to is 21+. So if you don
 't get in\, the pub crawl is not responsible for you!\n➡️ Every bar/cl
 ub we are going to is less than 5 mins walking from the next one. So don
 ’t worry about needing to walk any sort of long distance.\n➡️ Make s
 ure to come early so you can socialize with the group before things get cr
 azy!\nGET YOUR TICKETS HERE- pubcrawltoronto.com/book-now/
LOCATION:Tha Phae Tavern
