 s nearly here\, which means the FIFA World Cup is just around the corner. 
 This is our FINAL community workshop before diving head-first into program
 ming and collaborating.\nThroughout the winter and spring\, we have conduc
 ted 3 community workshops intending to build capacity towards the summer. 
 We now have over a dozen activations prepared\, throughout the city geared
  towards welcoming hundreds of thousands of visitors this summer.\nWe invi
 te any and all working in bars\, restaurants\, music venues\, hotels\, mus
 eums and anyone connected with the tourism and hospitality sectors. We inv
 ite business owners\, football fans and community builders\, bureaucrats a
 nd BIAs\, not-for-profits and galleries. Come one\, come all\, and lets en
 sure that all our boats rise with the same tide. As my ancestors said: Tuk
 o Pamoja. We are stronger together.\nOur aim with this workshop is to crea
 te shared resources to showcase and promote our projects and cultural even
 ts.\nIf you'd like any more information\, send an email to rashid@dromarti
 stcollective.org
