 83.jpg
DESCRIPTION:The Scenario Presents: First Bloody Cypher\nYou shout it. They
  spit it. No script. No mercy. Just bars.\nThis improvised hip hop musical
  drops you straight into a never-before-seen 80s action movie – built li
 ve from your suggestion of a hero and a mission. Fueled by original beats 
 and freestyled in real time\, the show blasts through explosive montages\,
  cinematic showdowns\, and razor-sharp one-liners. Think the raw action of
  Die Hard colliding with the street energy of Beat Street. No script. No s
 afety net. Just a high-octane\, beat-driven ride where anything will happe
 n – and every line hits to the maxx.\nCast: PHATT al\, Katie Chin\, Lanc
 e Oribello\, Ryan Troke\nGRIIINDHOUSE\nBANNED IN OVER 46 COUNTRIES. RATED 
 X.\nStep into the sticky floors of the Bad Dog GRINDHOUSE. Back for the th
 ird time\, this year's ode to disgusting\, debaucherous and deplorable out
  of print Sin-ema vows to push boundaries further than ever before. More N
 udity! More Death!! More Drugs!!! MORE......GRIIINDHOUSE!!!!\nCast: Leslie
  Cserepy\, Ghazal Ghiami\, Sachin Sinha\, Nicole Passmore
LOCATION:Videocabaret\, Deanne Taylor
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/the-scenario-presents-first-bloody-cyphe
 r-and-grindhouse-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
