BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Achillean Blood On the Clocktower at Super Bargain Bar - Downtown
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260513T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260513T210000
UID:blogto-234200@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/04/26/original_image348ce774-234f-48a6-8e80-430ff4829b
 d8.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Whether you're a seasoned gamer or new to the world of social 
 deception games\, this event offers something for everyone. Come solo or w
 ith friends and immerse yourself in a game of Blood on the Clocktower. Our
  events are a great way to connect with members of local communities and a
 re perfect for folks arriving in Toronto looking to make new connections.\
 nWhat is Blood on the Clocktower? - Blood on the Clocktower is an advanced
  version of the game Werewolf\, where crucially\, the dead still have an i
 mportant role to play in the game. The game is run by a Storyteller who ha
 s carefully crafted an experience and facilitates the game for up to 20 pl
 ayers. It is part deduction and part deception. Set in the town of Ravensw
 ood Bluff\, players in the game assume different roles\, each with unique 
 abilities to hunt down evil or manipulate the townsfolk.\nThanks to the ge
 nerosity of Super Bargain Bar\, we will have plenty of space for the night
  to engage in the social deduction of Blood on the Clocktower. Super Barga
 in has a menu with both alcoholic and nonalcoholic beverages that you can 
 order from while we’re having fun deducing and deceiving. Tickets for th
 is event are $20 or $13.50 for Changeling Special Events Members.\nWhereve
 r you are on the achillean spectrum\, you are invited to join us!\nIf you 
 have not played before or are newer to the game\, there will be a quick tu
 torial at the top of the event to learn how to play and ask any questions 
 from the Storyteller.\nWe will be playing the custom beginner-friendly Cha
 ngeling's Introduction at this event.\nAge recommendation\, 16 years +\nTo
  learn more\, find Changeling Gaming Events Toronto on Eventbrite or click
  the website link to see this event (see right side on desktop/above on mo
 bile).
LOCATION:Super Bargain
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/achillean-blood-on-the-clocktower-at-sup
 er-bargain-bar-downtown-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:An Oil Painting Experience by Artbox
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260513T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260513T220000
UID:blogto-234053@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/04/22/original_image0eb184cf-c9b4-4464-be57-b357c33ae4
 73.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a guided oil painting workshop where you’ll expl
 ore the rich colour\, softness\, and depth of oil paint.\nWhat to Expect:\
 nPerfect for both beginners and those refining their practice\, this works
 hop guides you step-by-step through sketching\, layering\, blending\, and 
 building highlights and shadows to create realism and vibrancy. You’ll l
 earn time-honoured oil painting techniques with supportive guidance throug
 hout.\nGuided Instruction:\nLearn foundational oil painting methods from a
 n experienced artist—from initial sketch to final detail work—using la
 yering\, glazing\, and observation of light.\nCreative Freedom: Customize 
 your painting with your own tones\, brushwork style\, and level of realism
  or looseness.\nAll Materials Included: High-quality oil paints\, brushes\
 , palette knives\, apron\, stretched canvas\, to-go box\, and all other ne
 cessary supplies are included.\nRelaxed Studio Atmosphere: Enjoy a relaxed
 \, inspiring space with soft music and uplifting creative energy.\nSnacks 
 & Refreshments: Complimentary coffee\, tea\, water and snacks available th
 roughout.\nWho Should Join:\nSuitable for beginners and intermediate artis
 ts.\nMust be ages 12+. Participants under 18 must be accompanied by a payi
 ng 18+ adult.\nLimited spots available — reserve your canvas today.\nSee
  more events at: https://www.artboxstudiogallery.com/calendar\nCall us at:
  647-617-9550
LOCATION:Artbox Studio Gallery
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/an-oil-painting-experience-by-artbox-tor
 onto-10/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
