BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Bleeding Edge Presents: Canadian Premiere of LOCKJAW
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260513T203000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260513T220000
UID:blogto-234720@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/05/06/original_imagec0250611-521f-43dd-9109-18ddc698c4
 b2.jpg
DESCRIPTION:On May 13th\, Bleeding Edge invites you to the Canadian premie
 re of Sabrina Greco’s Lockjaw\, a darkly comic look at life with your mo
 uth wired shut! It plays at Paradise Theatre for ONE NIGHT ONLY! Tickets a
 vailable HERE!\nWriter/Director Sabrina Greco and Editor/Cinematographer N
 eal Wynne will be in attendance for a live Q&A!\nSix weeks after getting i
 nto a drunk driving accident that leaves her jaw wired shut\, Rayna (Blu H
 unt) tries to have a fun night out with her friends.\nA hilarious comedy o
 f manners\, the film over an efficient 77-minute runtime breaks down the c
 omplicated social dynamics that compromise modern living. Containing a hig
 hly memorable ensemble cast of characters\, you’ll find yourself not wan
 ting to leave their orbit\, no matter how much they make your skin crawl.
LOCATION:Paradise Theatre
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/bleeding-edge-presents-canadian-premiere
 -of-lockjaw-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
