 gto.com/events/2026/05/04/original_image4b5a53aa-89e0-410e-8148-0058ac3386
 58.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a special community celebration marking an importa
 nt milestone for our organization\, as we mark two years of impactful work
  in Jane-Finch\, alongside the recognition of the Toronto Community Champi
 on Award (Etobicoke-York).\nThe evening will begin with the unveiling of F
 lourishing Joy\, a vibrant new mural by artists Pamella Chang and Jamera D
 aCosta\, celebrating creativity\, connection\, and the spirit of Jane-Finc
 h.\nWe will also be launching Through the Lens of Dreamers 2.0\, the retur
 n of our annual outdoor exhibition\, featuring 16 artworks by 14 resident 
 artists and highlighting powerful creative voices from Indigenous\, Black\
 , and other equity-deserving communities. As part of the celebration\, we 
 will unveil the exhibition banner and gather as a community to reflect\, c
 onnect\, and share this meaningful moment together.\nThis recognition spea
 ks to the collective work being done to support the health\, interests\, a
 nd well-being of Toronto\, and we are truly honoured to celebrate it along
 side the community that continues to inspire us.
LOCATION:Jane-Finch Mall
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/community-celebration-mural-unveiling-to
