 04.jpg
DESCRIPTION:You have just 30 minutes to make a Power Point presentation on
  a bizarre topic you know nothing about ⁠— then just 3 minutes to pres
 ent it live!\nSign up in advance and submit your wackiest Power Point topi
 cs here: https://forms.gle/xVJoA6868tePnh988\nJoin us Wednesday\, May 13th
  at 8:30 p.m. at Danu Social House (1237 Queen St W.)\, hosted by Power Po
 int aficionado Haydn Watters.\nGive us a few weird and wonderful presentat
 ion topics in advance you would like to see others present on (and you thi
 nk other people probably don't know much about!). When you arrive\, we'll 
 give you a topic you know absolutely nothing about in return. Past topics 
 include why Toronto needs more gargoyles\, normal behaviours that should b
 e punishable by law and ranking the best public bathrooms in Toronto.\nYou
 'll have 30 minutes to come up with a 3-minute Power Point on that very to
 pic. Then you'll present it in front of your new friends. All you need is 
 a laptop and a Power Point-like program you can create a slide deck on. Th
 ere's only one rule: NO CREATING ANY .PPTs IN ADVANCE!\nYou can play solo 
 or in a pair — and spectators are most welcome if you just want to cheer
  the Power Pointers on. We love spectators!
LOCATION:Danu Social House
