 gto.com/events/2026/05/05/original_image2bc4ee23-c239-4af1-952b-568e8833da
 f0.jpg
DESCRIPTION:I Picked This For You is a film photography exhibition that co
 nsiders how small\, intentional acts—choosing a flower\, tucking a love 
 note into a pocket\, setting an alarm to wake up and see the sunrise—rom
 anticize the everyday. It invites viewers to linger in quiet\, thoughtful 
 moments that might otherwise pass unnoticed.\nThe exhibition showcases ten
  images woven together through a distinct\, ethereal aesthetic\, as if ste
 pping into a dream. The images are shot exclusively on 35mm Kodak Gold fil
 m\, using natural light to capture shadows\, florals\, and unexpected beau
 ty.
