DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260514T220000
UID:blogto-234832@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/05/08/original_imagea9875f75-ad7a-40c8-ad8c-3eb15360b8
 db.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Gay trivia served with a side of CHAOS.\nIs Toronto a tough pl
 ace to meet new people? Tired of the apps? Try this! Q\nUESTIONABLE is tri
 via with a twist….\nThis is our SAPPHIC EDITION. Always trans and enby i
 nclusive.\nAlready have what you're looking for but have a friend who you 
 want to set up? Come pitch them!\nCome be part of the series that has beco
 me the stuff of legends.....\nThis event is at\nGROUND CONTROL\n1279 Queen
  Street West\nDoors at 7:30pm\nFirst Round starts at 8pm\nHosted by your f
 aves:\n@chaodykes\nHow does it work?\nYou will be put in a team with 5-6 p
 eople you don’t know.\nThere will be 2 rounds of trivia. Each round\, yo
 u will change teams! So\, by the end of the event you will have met 10-12 
 new people. Each round lasts about 40 minutes - just long enough to get to
  know someone’s vibe but not so long you are stuck with them all night!\
 nThere will be a DJ In the lounge after the event so you can stay after th
 e event to keep the conversations going!\nWhat does ‘single’ mean?\n'S
 ingle’ means you are open to connecting with other people for love\, lus
 t or friendship.\nMaybe you will meet your soulmate! Maybe you will meet y
 our new best friend! Maybe you will make out in the bathroom! Maybe you wi
 ll add a lover to your rotation! Maybe you will find a gaming parter! Basi
 cally - you should be available to connect with people in some way.\nThe e
 vent is poly-friendly\, slut-friendly\, monogamy-friendly\, ace-friendly. 
 If you can’t leave your judgment of others at home\, then you should sta
 y home.\nSchedule\n7:30pm - Doors Open\, you get put into your first team\
 n8pm - First Round starts\n10pm - Expected end\, but you can stay to socia
 lize!\nCost\nWe are doing a sliding scale of $7-$25.\nAll funds are going 
 to Glad Day Lit to support 2SLGBTQ artists and community events.\nHow will
  you make the teams?\nThe teams will mostly be random.\nHow many people ca
 n attend?\nOur max number for this event is 85 people.This event can sell 
 out and the lower price tickets sell out first\, so act fast.\nYou can ema
 il any questions to have to: vip@gladday.ca
LOCATION:Ground Control
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/questionable-sapphic-edition-queer-singl
 es-trivia-toronto-4/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
