 iday\, May 15\, 2026\nTime: 6:30 pm – 8:00 pm (arrive 10 min early to se
 ttle in)\nFee: $55 CAD + HST (instruction + supplies + wine)\nAges: 10 + (
 under-18 accompanied by paying adult)\nCapacity: 25 seats → this event s
 ells out fast—hit “Register Now” below!\nBooking & Policies\nClick R
