BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Trading Spouses & Mrs. Beast Invites you to a Movie Set
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260515T213000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260515T223000
UID:blogto-233598@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/04/13/original_image37e9f6ce-47c7-42fb-9488-4d7512e04b
 b7.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Trading Spouses: Improvised!\nMeet your new mommy\nDo you ever
  wish your family could've been on an episode of early 2000s chaotic reali
 ty television shows "Trading Spouses" or "Wife Swap"? Well your wish could
  come true at TRADING SPOUSES: IMPROVISED! Our cast will interview two aud
