 8c.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Introducing “Hidden Toronto” – the light-hearted walking
  tour from the creators of The Haunted Walk that’s gonna have you chuckl
 ing with laughter and shaking your head in disbelief. Join our crew of sto
 rytelling guides as we take you on a 90-minute adventure through the hidde
 n side of Toronto. No boring history here! We’re all about the bizarre a
 nd unexpected side of the city we love. From misbehaving mayors to racoon 
 funerals. From movie mistakes to our infamous clown riot\, these fun tales
  of mischief and mayhem make up the fascinating story of our city. Guffaw 
 and gasp through the city’s streets as our fun and engaging tour guides 
 spill the beans on those little-known stories and secrets that define Toro
 nto’s hidden personality. “Hidden Toronto” is a fun and engaging goo
 d-natured adventure\, perfect for first-time visitors and locals alike. Yo
 u won’t find this side of the city in any guidebook!
