UID:blogto-234716@blogto.com
DESCRIPTION:Come on a road trip like no other -  an iconic 1957 global exp
 edition with artist Robert Bateman and biologist Bristol Foster. No packin
 g\, no planning. Just show up and enjoy the ride.\n"A film that doesn't ju
 st show you some wild places\, it invites you to feel it"\nPost screening 
 discussion with filmmaker Alison Reid and broadcaster Dini Petty.
LOCATION:Bloor Hot Docs Cinema
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/the-art-of-adventure-toronto-2/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
