 DS AND KIDS AT HEART - AN EVENT FOR ALL AGES\nDate: Sunday\, May 17th\, 20
 26\nTime: 11:00am - 3:00 pm\nKidultland Cafe\n1091 Queen St. East\nFREE sc
 avenger hunt\nFREE activities\nFREE gift when you spend $10 or more\n⭐ S
 ticker Swap: Bring your vintage and new stickers and pick up some new ones
 .\n⭐ Crafts and Games  - We also have some fun stickering activities and
