 uly meet people. Step away from the apps and into real connection.\nJoin S
 ingle in the City for a curated Speed Dating experience designed for ambit
 ious singles who value their time.\nMeet up to 15 local singles face-to-fa
 ce in a series of relaxed\, low-pressure conversations.\nBecause the right
