 ur experienced instructor guides you step by step through hand-building te
 chniques and essential tools. Create a functional and/or decorative clay p
 iece such as a catch-all tray\, pen holder\, glasses holder\, and so much 
 more—each piece uniquely yours.\nWhat’s Included:\n• Guided instruct
 ion with personalized tips\n• High-quality sculpting tools\, no-bake cla
 y\, apron\, and all supplies\n• Relaxing studio ambiance\n• Snacks and
  refreshments included\nOptional Finishing Kit:\nAdd a finishing kit to re
 ceive a waterproof glaze top coat\, paint colours of your choice\, sandpap
 er\, and brushes to complete your piece once dry.\nYou’ll take your scul
 pture home the same day. Pieces dry in approximately 24 hours\, after whic
 h you can finish and seal them at your own pace.\nWho Can Attend:\nPerfect
  for beginners and experienced sculptors alike\, and anyone seeking a calm
 \, creative experience in a supportive setting. Ages 8+ welcome. Participa
 nts ages 8–16 must attend with a paying 18+ adult.\nNo experience needed
