ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/04/26/original_image1c7cb275-841e-4bea-a08f-7e84cd77e6
 31.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Whether you're a seasoned gamer or new to the world of Tableto
 p Role Playing Games (TTRPGs)\, this event offers something for everyone. 
 Come solo or with friends and immerse yourself in a game of Werewolf: The 
 Apocalypse. This adventure seats up to 6 players.\nOur events are a great 
 way to connect with members of local communities and are also perfect for 
 folks arriving in Toronto looking to make new friends.\nWhat is Werewolf: 
 The Apocalypse?: Each player is a werewolf\, raging against the supernatur
 al elements threatening to destroy the world at large. They are charged wi
 th the aid of spirits with protecting against the apocalypse and balancing
  their inherent rage lest they lose control of themselves.\nWhat is a One-
 Shot?: It is a complete story in one session of gameplay.\nGeneral Admissi
 on Tickets: Tickets to this event include a private room for you and your 
 fellow adventurers\, access to the Left Field Brewery menu and drink selec
 tions\, one of our expert Game Masters to run a full how-to-play (if any n
 ew players are in attendance) and an immersive playthrough of a one-shot w
 ith accompanying music.\nPlayer Experience: Any! - Little to no experience
  with the game\, or looking to build confidence\, or just have fun!\nEquip
 ment: We will provide paper\, pencils\, and of course\, dice for you to bo
 rrow. We also use Chaotic Studios dice kits to help support new players in
  getting familiar with the different-sized dice as needed by the system.\n
 To learn more\, find Changeling Gaming Events Toronto on Eventbrite or cli
 ck the website link to see this event (see right side on desktop/above on 
 mobile).
LOCATION:Left Field Brewery Liberty Village
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/learn-play-werewolf-the-apocalypse-a-pre
 mium-rpg-experience-toronto/
