  dance floor moving late into the night.\nDJ Kash\nThe highly respected an
 d beloved Toronto-based DJ Kash has performed at prominent venues and fest
 ivals across the GTA\, spinning both favourites and lesser-known tracks to
  the delight of Latin dancers of all tastes. Put on your dancing shoes and
  head to Lula for a late-night mix of bachata\, salsa\, and tropical hits.
 \nArrive right at 11 pm to catch the final moments of the live set by 9 de
 l Barrio\, led by Ruddy Bolaños\, before the dance floor takes over late 
 into the night.\nLate kitchen • Late last call\nBottle Service\nReservat
