 a5.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Canada’s premier Latin music and dance club invites you to e
 xperience an unforgettable night of salsa — dinner\, dancing\, and live 
 music all under one roof!\nBook a table for dinner and dancing\, or arrive
  after 9 PM to head straight to the dance floor.\nEvening Schedule\n� 7:
 00 PM – Doors open for dinner and drinks\n� 9:00 PM – Salsa lesson (
 no partner needed!)\n� 10:00 PM – Live salsa set\n� 11:00 PM – Kee
 p the energy going with Lula's Global Late Night Party!\nAbout the Band\n9
  Del Barrio is Toronto’s newest compact salsa band\, founded in 2024 and
  already making waves with a big\, dancer-driven sound. Blending Puerto Ri
 can and Venezuelan salsa with Dominican merengue and Colombian cumbia\, th
 e band delivers relaxed yet high-energy grooves marked by punchy horns and
  catchy melodies. Led by acclaimed bassist Ruddy Bolanos\, a veteran of th
 e Toronto Latin scene since the early 1990s who has worked with major inte
 rnational and local artists\, 9 Del Barrio brings together top-tier musici
 ans from across Latin America\, making them a powerful presence in Toronto
 ’s salsa scene and an ideal fit for intimate venues and special events.\
 nWhy Lula is unique:\nThe only venue of its kind in North America\, Lula L
 ounge features a rotating roster of more than a dozen full salsa orchestra
 s every Friday and Saturday—year-round. Our stage welcomes the best loca
 l talent alongside special guests from across Canada and the Americas\, of
 fering a one-of-a-kind salsa experience in a warm\, colourful\, and inclus
 ive space
LOCATION:Lula Lounge
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/latin-fridays-w-9-del-barrio-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
