 gto.com/events/2026/04/15/original_imagea821003b-c584-488f-9aa7-ccb419dd56
 b3.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Are you looking for an amazing music education for your child 
 or teen? Do they love to sing? Register them for an audition to sing with 
 TCC in the 2026/27 season which starts in September. TCC is a vibrant musi
 cal community that has welcomed and nurtured young voices from the GTA for
  almost 50 years. TCC's internationally-acclaimed choir programs include s
 inging\, vocal technique\, theory\, and the pursuit of joy and excellence 
 in choral singing. There are 8 choirs so young singers are placed into the
  right choir for them based on their age\, skill level and experience.\nYo
 u must pre-register for an audition. You will be assigned an audition time
  when you register.
