 01.jpg
DESCRIPTION:The Canadian air guitar event of the season is BACK! Witness t
 he face-melting riffs of Canada's greatest air guitarists from across the 
 country go head-to-head to see who is most deserving of the the title of 2
 026 Canadian Air Guitar Champion! The winner will jet off to represent Can
 ada at the 2026 Air Guitar World Championships in Oulu\, Finland this Augu
 st 26-29th!\nAir Guitar is an expression of World Peace - When you are hol
 ding an Air Guitar\, you can’t be holding a gun! Air Guitar Canada is a 
 not-for-profit and all our events benefit our chosen charity partner. This
  year\, we're partnering with Food Banks Canada to support fighting hunger
  across Canada! #MakeAirNotWar\nBring cash to Boost the Ballot\, or shelf-
 stable food items to be donated to the Toronto Food Bank to earn yourself 
 some extra votes! Limit of 5 food items per attendee.\nThink you've got wh
 at it takes to win it all? Sign up to compete as a Dark Horse! Registratio
 n for competitors closes May 19th!\nWondering how it all works? Get all th
 e details on our website!\nACCESSIBILITY NOTICE: Ground Control is a first
 -floor venue accessible with no stairs at the entrance and an accessible w
 ashroom on site. 19+. Alcohol served on site. Unisex bathrooms on site. Th
 is show will involve flashing lights and loud music.
