BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Candles\, Confections\, and Connections - Ladies' Social
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260523T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260523T160000
UID:blogto-234521@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/05/02/original_image027a7d10-3ebf-493c-8505-a1f3ab9ee0
 fb.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Overview\nAn afternoon designed for women who want to meet the
 ir people. Candles\, chocolate\, compatibility matching\, and good company
 .\nTHE AFTERNOON\nThere's a specific kind of friendship that's hard to fin
 d as an adult. The kind where someone gets you without explanation. Where 
 conversation comes easily. Where you leave feeling more like yourself\, no
 t less.\nThat's what this afternoon is about.\nWe've designed an experienc
 e for women who are open to meeting people they actually click with. Our c
 ompatibility matching does the heavy lifting\, so you can focus on showing
  up.\nBEFORE YOU ARRIVE\nOnce you purchase your ticket\, you'll receive a 
 short compatibility questionnaire. It takes about 10 minutes.\nIn the days
  leading up to the event\, you'll receive an email letting you know if you
  have one\, two\, or three top compatibility matches in the room.\nAT CHEC
 K-IN\nScan the QR code\, enter your email\, and your matches will be revea
 led to you on the spot. You'll have the rest of the afternoon to find them
 .\nCHOOSE YOUR WORKSHOP AT BOOKING\nYour ticket includes one of two worksh
 ops. You select which one when you checkout.\nCandle Making with Kallón. 
 Hand-pour your own signature scent. Twenty spots.\nChocolate Making with C
 hockalā. Craft your own artisan chocolates. Twenty spots.\nBoth groups sh
 are the rest of the afternoon together.\nTHE STATIONS\nBestie Bingo. Playe
 d throughout the afternoon as you meet the women in the room. First to fil
 l her card takes home a pair of 14K gold-plated earrings.\nTarot Readings.
  Five-minute personal messages. Sit\, listen\, take what resonates.\nPaint
  by Numbers. Slow\, considered. Solo or side by side. Take it home.\nLEGO.
  Build alone\, build together\, or pull up a chair and chat while someone 
 else does the work.\nJenga. The questions are already on the blocks.\nHOW 
 THE AFTERNOON FLOWS\n1:00 PM. Arrival. Doors open. Welcome drink at check-
 in. Scan in to reveal your matches\, grab your bingo card\, settle in.\n1:
 30 PM. The afternoon begins. A short opening moment to set the tone\, intr
 oduce HUMRĀ\, and walk you through the flow.\n1:45 PM onward. Workshops a
 nd stations open. Candle making and chocolate making run in parallel. Taro
 t\, paint\, lego\, and jenga are open throughout. The drink station is ava
 ilable all afternoon.\n4:00 PM. The afternoon ends. What happens after is 
 up to you.\nWHO THIS IS FOR\nAdult friendship is harder than it should be.
  Maybe your closest people moved away. Maybe you outgrew the friendships y
 ou had. Maybe you've been heads-down on other parts of your life and you'r
 e ready to make space for new people. Whatever brought you here\, you want
  to spend a Saturday around women who are looking for the same thing.\nThi
 s afternoon is for you.\nWe match on life stage and values\, not age. The 
 room will reflect that.\nDRESS CODE\nComfortable enough to make and create
 . Considered enough to feel like yourself at your best.\nGOOD TO KNOW\nDoo
 rs open at 1:00 PM. The afternoon begins at 1:30 PM. Please plan to arrive
  by 1:15 PM.\nRily Kitchen\, 26 Sousa Mendes Street\nToronto\, ON M6P 3Z5\
 nA charcuterie box is available as an add-on at checkout for $20.\nA drink
  station is open throughout the afternoon\, with alcoholic and non-alcohol
 ic options available for purchase.\n21+. Tickets are non-refundable.\nFull
  arrival details will be sent to ticket holders by email ahead of the even
 t.\nHUMRĀ facilitates introductions and curated experiences. We do not gu
 arantee outcomes.\nABOUT HUMRĀ\nHUMRĀ is a Toronto matchmaking collectiv
 e built on a simple belief: that the right people\, in the right room\, fi
 nd each other.\nWe design experiences for people who take connection serio
 usly\, from intimate singles evenings to private matchmaking to afternoons
  like this one. Our name comes from the legend of the red string of fate: 
 people bound together long before they meet. We believe that. We also beli
 eve destiny benefits from a little help.\nIf today is your first HUMRĀ ex
 perience\, we're glad you're here. It won't be your last.\nhumra.love · h
 ello@humra.love\nQuestions? Reach us at hello@humra.love. We respond withi
 n 24 hours\, always a real person\, never a bot.
LOCATION:Rily Kitchen
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/candles-confections-and-connections-ladi
 es-social-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
