 ñez\, Cándido Fabré\, Pupy y los que Son Son\, and Los Van Van.\nWhy Lu
 la is unique:\nThe only venue of its kind in North America\, Lula Lounge f
 eatures a rotating roster of more than a dozen full salsa orchestras every
  Friday and Saturday—year-round. Our stage welcomes the best local talen
 t alongside special guests from across Canada and the Americas\, offering 
