 gto.com/events/2026/05/07/original_imagea38d30d7-88e5-4ee4-889b-3a570bda95
 96.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a deep dive into the world of navigating the digit
 al landscape as an artist\nOne of the biggest challenges facing artists in
  2026 is the harrowing experience of navigating the digital world.\nTechno
 logy has had a huge impact on the world of art itself\, influencing both t
 he creation and the experience of art in many ways. We will discuss the ch
 allenges and opportunities available through technology\, predominantly th
 rough social networks and online spaces\, and how we\, as artists\, can op
 erate in this changing landscape.\n[Please note: this class will NOT talk 
 about utilizing generative AI or other AI technology\; in fact\, we'll bri
 efly discuss the ethical and industry challenges brought forward by AI. Es
 sentially\, f--- AI]
LOCATION:Remote Gallery
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/being-an-artist-in-the-digital-age-toron
 to/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
