  | Chris Campos\nPortugal’s tribal house powerhouse David Tort returns t
 o Wiggle Room for a night that hits different.\nAfter tearing up the dance
 floor last year and feeling the raw energy of Wiggle Room\, David went bac
 k to the studio inspired—and now he’s bringing that energy full circle
 . Join us for the official release party of his brand new track on Wiggle 
 Room Records\, a deeply personal tribute crafted straight from the heart\,
  dedicated to the unforgettable vibe of our home\, Wiggle Room.\nThis isn
 ’t just another booking—this is a moment. A connection between artist 
 and dancefloor\, captured in sound and unleashed where it all began.\nOne 
 night. One vibe. One story.  David Tort is coming home to make Everybody W
 iggle!.\nAdvance Tickets:\nEarly Wiggler: $20\nThe Wiggler: $25\nPerforman
 ces:\n10-12  Junior Lopez\n12-1  TAKiN\n1-4  DAVID TORT\n4-close Chris Cam
 pos\nVJ SEKS\n#WiggleRoomToronto is the #HomeofBouncyBeats\nOptions for pr
 epaid table/ticket packages (ONE ticket = everything mentioned):\n1) The 3
 rd Wheel: $363\nincludes: 3 General Admissions\; 1 Bottle of Stoli Vodka\n
