 08.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate design\, creativity\, and community with DesignTO in
  Toronto’s vibrant King East Design District (KEDD)!\nThe KEDD Party ret
 urns as a roaming neighbourhood celebration\, with six dynamic Party Hubs 
 offering unique experiences at every stop. Whether you hop between hubs or
  settle in at your favourite\, this can’t-miss night brings together des
 igners\, design-lovers\, and curious creatives for an evening of connectio
 n and discovery.\nArtopex\, 366 Adelaide Street East\, Suite 130 @ Sherbou
 rne Street\nBlinds To Go\, 330 King Street East @ Parliament Street\nCanda
 ce & Basil\, 75 Ontario Street @ Richmond Street East\nDesign Within Reach
  Toronto\, 214 King Street East @ Sherbourne Street\nEngel & Völkers Toro
 nto City\, 71 King Street East @ Church Street\nHome Société\, 570 Adela
 ide Street East @ Parliament Street\nView Party Hub Locations on Google Ma
 ps\nThe King East Design District Party is free\, but attendees must RSVP.
  Guests can check in at any Party Hub to get a wristband\, and then move b
 etween venues. Venues have capacity limits.\n–––\nThe ‘King East D
 esign District Party presented by DesignTO’ is supported by the Old Town
