BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Latin American Dinner Party for Couples @ Que Rico
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260530T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260530T223000
UID:blogto-234549@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/05/03/original_imagefcfdc4f4-d6f0-4075-9d7e-76b3a7f2ae
 9a.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Grab your partner and join us for a vibrant dinner party exclu
 sively for couples on Saturday\, May 30th at Que Rico Tapas Bar in Toronto
 .\nThis exclusive event is the perfect opportunity to welcome the new seas
 on\, enjoy incredible food\, and connect with other couples looking to bui
 ld friendships within our growing\, vibrant GTA community.\nWe are limitin
 g this event to just 10 COUPLES\; on a first-come first-served basis\, ens
 uring a relaxed atmosphere where conversation flows as easily as the cockt
 ails.\nYOUR EVENT EXPERIENCE:\nYour ticket fee covers your entry and treat
 s you to a curated start to your evening:\n- Complimentary Welcome Shot: S
 tart the night with a complimentary shot of Margarita upon arrival.\n\n- S
 hareable light snacks: Enjoy complimentary Mexican chips served with fresh
 \, signature guacamole to kick off your dining experience.\n- Vibrant Comm
 unity: A unique chance to meet other couples from across the GTA in a fun\
 , pressure-free environment.\nABOUT QUE RICO:\nLocated on College Street\,
  Que Rico Tapas Bar is the "daughter house" of the iconic El Convento Rico
 . Bringing a fresh energy to the scene\, Que Rico is dedicated to offering
  a variety of special Hispanic and Latin American dishes crafted by Chef P
 edro Quintanilla and his team. Every dish—from traditional tacos and zes
 ty ceviche to crispy croquetas and savory ropa vieja—is prepared to savo
 ry perfection.\nThe atmosphere is just as curated as the menu. With authen
 tic decor\, warm lighting\, and a lively\, welcoming energy\, Que Rico pro
 vides the perfect backdrop for an energetic Spring celebration.\nEVENT FEE
 S:\n$10 per person ($22.90 per couple including fees and taxes). This cove
 rs your event fee\, networking and the opportunity to meet other couples t
 o grow your social network (food and beverage sold separately at the venue
 )\nThe Social Couple™ is dedicated to curating sophisticated and engagin
 g experiences for couples — from exclusive chef-curated dinners and priv
 ate social events to exciting day trips. This new venture is designed for 
 couples looking to build new friendships and enjoy a curated sophisticated
  social calendar.
LOCATION:Que Rico Tapas Bar
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/latin-american-dinner-party-for-couples-
 que-rico-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
