 er clay figurines!\n5-9PLAYHAUS is coming to STACKT Market! We are opening
  our doors to new friends and inviting their creativity!\nThis event is ho
 sted by Diem of 5-9PLAYHAUS\, who will guide you through every step of the
  way. These craft nights feature specially designed clay moulds that help 
 you keep your proportions so you can focus on the fun part - the customizi
 ng! All clay\, materials\,and tools are provided. Guests can find food and
