BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Next To Normal
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260530T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260530T220000
UID:blogto-233288@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/04/07/original_imaged5425595-bd73-43cc-9082-9023986f92
 eb.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Bowtie Productions is proud to announce their new production o
 f Next To Normal featuring an all-Canadian cast will take place May 30-Jun
 e 6\, 2026 at Native Earth’s Aki Studio in Toronto. With book and lyrics
  by Brian Yorkey and music by Tom Kitt\, this winner of three 2009 Tony Aw
 ards\, and the 2010 Pulitzer Prize\, is an electrifying and poignant depic
 tion of a family in crisis trying to overcome the past.\nDirected by Antho
 ny Goncharov\, Next To Normal will star April Rebecca as Diana\, Taylor Lo
 ng as Dan\, Aveleigh Keller as Natalie\, Christopher Lyon as Gabe\, Samel 
 Sunil as Henry\, and Mich Anger as Dr Madden/Dr Fine. They're the perfect 
 suburban family - Dad's an architect\, brother and sister are acing their 
 classes\, and Mom's keeping them all together. There's just one small deta
 il nobody wants to acknowledge - Mom's been battling bipolar disorder and 
 delusional episodes for 16 years. Next to Normal is a compassionate look i
 nto how a family copes when mental health verges on the sublime.
LOCATION:Native Earth's Aki Studio
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/next-to-normal-toronto-3/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Other People's Treasure BINGO
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260530T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260530T220000
UID:blogto-234243@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/04/27/original_image9caa7e4a-8fec-4996-b931-7542fd9c6b
 fe.jpg
DESCRIPTION:BINGO is back in a big way! Only at The RHINO can you play B-I
 -N-G-O for other people’s treasure.\nThat’s right\, we’re playing Ot
 her People’s Treasure Bingo\, where contestants bring prizes from their 
 homes that they no longer need\, but know someone else would love.\nIn bet
 ween BINGO ball calls\, we’ll tell the stories of the treasures looking 
 for a new home.\nDon’t miss Other People’s Treasure BINGO\, save your 
 spot now.\nHERE'S HOW IT WORKS\n1. Bring something from your home that you
  once treasured but don’t have a use for anymore and want to give a new 
 home.\n2.We play some good old-fashioned BINGO\, the prize for each round 
 is someone else’s treasure.\n3. While we’re calling out numbers\, we s
 peak with the person who brought the prize to learn more about it and them
 .\n4. You do something you wouldn’t normally do\, have a good time and m
 eet new people.
LOCATION:The Rhino
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/other-peoples-treasure-bingo-toronto-11/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
