 gto.com/events/2026/05/06/original_imageb92cde4c-4cc7-41f6-87c1-5662ed3899
 a1.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Join us in Markham for a heartwarming Puppy Yoga experience fe
 aturing adorable English Bulldog puppies!\nThis gentle\, beginner-friendly
  class combines simple yoga movement with the playful and lovable nature o
 f English Bulldog puppies in a relaxed studio setting. As you flow through
  an easy\, feel-good yoga session\, the puppies will roam freely around th
 e space—snuggling up\, exploring\, and bringing plenty of joy\, laughter
 \, and unforgettable moments.\nThe focus is on relaxation\, connection\, a
 nd mindfulness\, making it perfect for all levels—no yoga experience nee
 ded. It’s a unique way to unwind\, de-stress\, and enjoy the calming pre
 sence of puppies while moving your body and lifting your mood.\nWhether yo
 u’re joining solo\, with friends\, or as a group\, Puppy Yoga by Yoga Ka
 wa in Markham promises a truly memorable experience filled with smiles\, c
 uddles\, and pure puppy happiness. 🐶✨
LOCATION:Sunrise Montessori Markham 180 Amber St\, Markham\, L3R 3J8
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/puppy-yoga-by-yoga-kawa-markham-english-
 bulldogs-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
