BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Board Game Night at Red Tape Brewery in East End Toronto
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260531T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260531T200000
UID:blogto-234196@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/04/26/original_image79b3d29b-12e9-48d4-9c0b-4ef6e21cb3
 55.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Whether you're a seasoned gamer or new to the world of board g
 ames\, this event offers something for everyone. Discover new games\, chal
 lenge your friends\, and make new connections with fellow board game lover
 s along the way. Come as a group or solo and we can help pair you with a c
 ommunity table. Our events are a great way to connect with members of loca
 l communities and are perfect for folks arriving in Toronto looking to mee
 t new people.\nFor games\, we have plenty to choose from including Coup\, 
 Codenames\, Splendor\, Catan\, Love Letter\, and many more! You are welcom
 e to bring games from your own collection if you wish. And all board game 
 experience levels are welcome.\nThanks to the generosity of Red Tape Brewe
 ry we will have the full tap room to enjoy for the night and play board ga
 mes! General admission tickets are available for $10.00 including tax at t
 he door\, and are free for Changeling Members. Tickets for this event incl
 ude access to a curated collection of board games and support from on-site
