DESCRIPTION:IN FULL BLOOM is an experiential relaxation therapy workshop c
 ombining aromatherapy\, sound therapy and mindfulness-based practices desi
 gned to help you reconnect with your personal energetics and inner vitalit
 y.\nInspired by the natural intelligence of plants - rooted\, nourished\, 
