DESCRIPTION:Join us in Mississauga for a heartwarming Puppy Yoga experienc
 e featuring adorable English Bulldog puppies!\nThis gentle\, beginner-frie
 ndly class combines simple yoga movement with the playful\, affectionate n
 ature of English Bulldog puppies in a relaxed studio setting. As you flow 
