 e best:\nMain Room:\n10-11: Melanie Sutherland (Bouncy TechHouse)\n11-12: 
 RandomDoug (Tech House)\n12-1:30: TYLER HILL (Bass & Tech House)\n1:30-3: 
 Miz Megs (Bouncy Tech House)\n3-close: TAKiN (Bouncy Wiggly Beats)\n+ VJ P
 rabinsayami | Amir Nian | Swimming (lasers)\nDnB and Jungle Room:\nsettime
 s tba\nTechno Division:\n10-11: Burnin Vernon\n11-12: LEIIA\n12-1: Rami Ab
 urob (Techno)\n1-2:30  Barroness (Tech & Techno)\n2:30-close: NOUR (Techno
  & Psy Tech)\n+VJ SEKS\nOptions for prepaid table/ticket packages (ONE tic
 ket = everything mentioned\, inclusive of minimum tip):\n1) The 3rd Wheel:
  $363\nincludes: 3 General Admissions\; 1 Bottle of (BG) Vodka on Special\
 n2) Regular Package: $800\nincludes: 6 General Admissions\; 2 Regular Bott
 les of Choice (may email wigglyevents@gmail.com to specify choice)\n3) Pre
 mium Package: $1000\nincludes: 6 x VIP Access (Best view of the party)\; 2
