 )\nTo Arrange Special Packages - wigglyevents@gmail.com (sold separately o
 f admission)\nATM on site\nBar Service\n21+ event\nhosted by: Wiggly Event
 s\; Roost Radio\; OG Entertainmnt\; Dance Division\; Sunshine Frequencies\
 ; and Wiggle Room Toronto\n~ WiGGLE RESPONSIBLY ~\nWe have a strict code o
