DESCRIPTION:NeighbourLink North York presents the 4th Taste of North York 
 Community & Food Festival\, June 5-7 at Mel Lastman Square!\nCelebrate Nor
 th York’s vibrant cultures\, diverse cuisines and community connections 
 with delicious food vendors\, live music\, dancing\, artisans\, kid’s ac
 tivities and NeighbourLink’s Community Fair featuring 20+ local organiza
 tions.\nKorean\, Chinese\, Persian\, Ukrainian\, South American\, Caribbea
 n\, Filipino\, Brazilian\, Greek and Indian cultures will all be represent
 ed! Net proceeds support NeighbourLink’s food banks and community care p
 rograms.\nThere will be family activities including giant games\, caricatu
 res\, facepainting\, aerial hammocks\, mini-golf and more!\nDon’t forget
  to bring a non-perishable food item to cram a 32 division police cruiser 
 and support NeighbourLink’s food bank!\nJoin in the fun of building a mo
 re connected community together!\nLearn more at www.neighbourlink.org/tast
