DESCRIPTION:AccessFest\, with support from Lead Sponsor TD\,  is returning
  for its second year\, creating a space where accessibility\, inclusion 
 and culture come to life.\nOn Saturday\, June 6\, 2026\,  from 9:00 am to 
 9:00pm\, AccessFest will transform David Pecaut Square in downtown Toronto
  into a high-energy\, day-long outdoor festival. The festival’s particip
 atory programming features mainstage performances\, live music\, panel dis
 cussions\, immersive activations\, fitness activities\, a vendor market\, 
 and more – all led by people with lived experience with disability.\nAcc
 essFest is free\, barrier-free\, and built for everyone.\nLearn more at 
 AccessFest.ca.
