 \nBe the first to experience excerpts and works-in-progress from The Music
 al Stage Company\, Soulpepper Theatre and Luminato Festival. Featuring a d
 azzling showcase of four books & stands readings from visionary creators s
 haping the future of Canadian musical theatre\, with the opportunity to en
