 for June 18-19\, 2026\, at London\,UK\, and through a virtual platform for
  participants joining remotely. ChemCatalysis 2026 will be an event of gro
 undbreaking ideas and cutting-edge research\, offering a platform to explo
 re the latest innovations in catalysis and chemical engineering under the 
 theme of "Emerging Frontiers in Catalysis and Chemical Engineering". ChemC
 atalysis 2026 is designed for audiences\, attracting leading scientists\, 
 engineers\, industry leaders\, and passionate individuals dedicated to the
  advancement of catalysis and chemical engineering. The event serves as a 
 unique platform for professionals from various sectors to converge\, share
  their insights\, and contribute to the growth of these critical industrie
 s.
