SUMMARY:Kahil El Zabar & David Murray  WE BE FREE Tour
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260619T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260619T220000
UID:blogto-234172@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/04/26/original_image3fab9db0-98ce-4a40-aa27-91ffd97a62
 24.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Legendary percussionist and bandleader Kahil El'Zabar joins fo
 rces with saxophone icon David Murray for their 2026 tour\, WE BE FREE - a
  dynamic and deeply expressive program rooted in spiritual jazz improvisat
 ion\, and the ongoing exploration of freedom through sound.\nEl’Zabar & 
 Murray have captivated audiences worldwide for over 40 years\, selling out
