 67.jpg
DESCRIPTION:3rd World Summit and Expo on Renewable and Non-Renewable Energ
 y WSERNRE-2026 Welcome to the Future of Energy! We are honoured to invite 
 you to the 3rd World Summit and Expo on Renewable and Non Renewable Energy
  (WSERNRE 2026)\, organized by Scientific Summits\, taking place from June
  24–26\, 2026\, in Bern\, Switzerland.\nJoin us at the forefront of the 
 global energy landscape. This summit unites leading researchers\, industry
  innovators\, policymakers\, and environmental advocates to ignite dialogu
 e\, spark innovation\, and explore both renewable and non-renewable energy
  solutions.\nExpect a robust program of keynote addresses\, expert panels\
 , technical sessions\, interactive workshops\, and an expo showcasing brea
 kthrough technologies. Whether your expertise lies in solar\, wind\, hydro
 \, fossil fuels\, or nuclear energy\, WSERNRE 2026 is your stage to share 
 insights and co create a balanced\, sustainable energy future.\nBern\, wit
 h its blend of rich heritage and forward looking sustainability initiative
 s\, offers the perfect backdrop for this exciting global gathering.\nWe lo
 ok forward to your active participation\, your vision\, and your passion. 
 Together\, let’s power the future.
LOCATION:Bern\, Switzerland
