 gto.com/events/2026/05/04/original_image4f44cde5-330e-402e-9e5b-206fc05ea6
 91.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a night of connection\, energy and unforgettable m
 oments! Molcose Networking Experience is taking over an elegant event loft
  just minutes west of Sherway Gardens Mall in Mississauga!\nThis isn’t y
 our average networking event. Your ticket includes good food\, refreshing 
 drinks\, prizes and complimentary cocktails. From the moment you walk in\,
  you’ll feel the positive energy from Molcose Marketing team\, entrepren
 eurs\, creators\, professionals\, and community‑builders all mixing\, mi
 ngling\, and sparking real conversations.\nAnd here’s the twist everyone
  loves\; every ticket holder is automatically entered for a chance to win 
 $1\,000. Expect good vibes\, great people and a stylish atmosphere built f
 or meaningful connections. Please come dressed to impress\, socialize and 
 elevate your network!
