 gto.com/events/2026/01/08/original_imagedfc374a5-9750-45a4-877d-8b46e12277
 6d.jpg
DESCRIPTION:The Neon Riders are excited to announce the return of their an
 nual Pride Ride Toronto\, taking place on Thursday\, June 25\, 2026. This 
 vibrant and inclusive cycling event celebrates Pride Month\, bringing toge
 ther riders\, allies\, and supporters of the 2SLGBTQ+ community for an eve
 ning of visibility\, unity\, and fun.\nStarting at 7 PM\, riders will gath
 er at Nathan Phillips Square for a 20 km social ride through downtown Toro
 nto. Participants are encouraged to wear colorful outfits\, lights\, and f
 estive bike decorations that reflect the spirit of Pride.\nThe route will 
 pass through iconic Toronto landmarks\, including Queen’s Park and Churc
 h Street\, creating a moving celebration of color and community through th
 e city streets.\nThe ride is free\, open to all skill levels\, and designe
 d to be welcoming and inclusive. Helmets are strongly recommended for safe
 ty.\nRoute map and pit stop locations will be available in the Discussion 
 Section ahead of the event.\nEvent Details\nWhat: Pride Ride Toronto with 
 Neon Riders\nWhen: Thursday\, June 25\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM\nWhere: Nathan
  Phillips Square\nDistance: 20 km\nCost: Free\nAccessibility: Open to all 
 cycling levels\nSafety: Helmets strongly recommended\n#PrideRideTO #NeonRi
 ders #TorontoPride2026
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/toronto-pride-ride-2026-neon-riders-toro
 nto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
