 tails\, while mariachi bands\, salsa dancers and live performers keep the 
 atmosphere electric from day to night.\nIndulge in Mississauga’s top off
 erings from top chefs and local restaurants serving over 150 taco varietie
 s\, from traditional Mexican cuisine to new takes on classics and exclusiv
 e menu offerings.\nAll Taco Fest attendees will have the chance to vote fo
 r their favourite taco and crown the winner of the very first Taco Fest Mi
 ssissauga Best Taco.\nFamily entry time between 11 am - 3:30 pm: kids ages
