SUMMARY:2nd Edition of the International Obesity and Metabolism Conference
  IOMC 2026
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260717T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260717T180000
UID:blogto-227870@blogto.com
DESCRIPTION:2nd Edition of the International Obesity and Metabolism Confer
 ence (IOMC 2026)\nJuly 17–19\, 2026 | Singapore & Virtual\nPrecision Glo
 bal Conferences warmly invites you to the 2nd Edition of the International
  Obesity and Metabolism Conference (IOMC 2026)\, to be held from July 17 t
 o 19\, 2026\, in Singapore and virtually. This dynamic hybrid event will b
 ring together global experts\, researchers\, clinicians\, and advocates de
 dicated to advancing the understanding and treatment of obesity and metabo
 lic health.\nConference Theme:\nPrecision to Policy: New Frontiers in Obes
 ity and Metabolism Research\nWith the World Health Organization reporting 
 that global obesity rates have quadrupled among children and adolescents a
 nd doubled among adults between 1990 and 2022\, the urgency of tackling ob
 esity through multidisciplinary lens has never been greater. IOMC 2026 ser
 ves as a timely and essential platform to explore this complex condition f
 rom basic molecular research to clinical and public health strategies.\n
 🔗 More Information: https://www.internationalobesityconference.com/\n
 🔗 Submit Abstracts: https://www.internationalobesityconference.com/abst
 ract-submission.php\n🔗 Register Now: https://www.internationalobesityco
 nference.com/registration.php\n📧 Contact Us: obesity@pgconferences.com\
 nOrganizer:\nPrecision Global Conferences\n📍 601 King St Ste 200 #863\,
  Alexandria\, VA 22314\, United States\n📞 +1-571-5561014\n📩 obesity@
 precisionglobalconferences.com
LOCATION:Village Hotel Changi\, Singapore
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/2nd-edition-of-the-international-obesity
 -and-metabolism-conference-iomc-2026-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:2nd Edition of the Public Health World Conference PHWC 2026
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260717T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260717T180000
UID:blogto-229338@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/01/17/original_image862447f3-e733-46ef-81a4-d877f20987
 6a.jpg
DESCRIPTION:2nd Edition of the Public Health World Conference (PHWC 2026)\
 nJuly 17–19\, 2026 | Singapore & Virtual\nPrecision Global Conferences c
 ordially invites you to participate in the 2nd Edition of the Public Healt
 h World Conference (PHWC 2026)\, scheduled to be held from July 17 to 19\,
  2026\, in a hybrid format—onsite in Singapore and virtually for global 
 convenience.\nConference Theme: Public Health Preparedness in an Interconn
 ected World: Policies\, People\, and Progress\nThis global gathering aims 
 to unite public health professionals\, policymakers\, scholars\, and resea
 rchers to address emerging and recurring public health concerns. The secon
 d edition of PHWC builds on the resounding success of its inaugural confer
 ence\, continuing to promote knowledge exchange\, innovation\, and collabo
 ration across borders. The event aims to catalyze actionable solutions tha
 t enhance health equity\, system resilience\, and community health outcome
 s.\nPHWC 2026 emphasizes the importance of exploring cutting-edge trends i
 n public health surveillance\, preparedness\, and response. It provides a 
 vital platform for discussing global health priorities and supporting the 
 implementation of forward-thinking strategies across various domains of pu
 blic health\, including maternal and child health\, food security\, enviro
 nmental health\, and health systems management.\nMaternal Health Conferenc
 es | Food And Nutrition Conference 2026 | Reproductive Health Conference 2
 026 | Family Planning Conference 2026 | Maternal Health Conference 2026 | 
 Health Services Management Conferences | Communicable Diseases conferences
  | Communicable Diseases Conferences 2026 | Aging Health Conference | Agin
 g Health Conference 2026 | Public Health Conference | Public Health Confer
 ences 2026 | Public Health Conferences | Public Health Events | Public Hea
 lth Conference 2026 | International Public Health Conference | Public Heal
 th Meetings | Public Health Congress | Public Health Congress 2026 | Upcom
 ing Public Health Conferences | Singapore Public Health Conference | Publi
 c Health 2026 | Public Health Events 2026 | Public Health Meetings 2026 | 
 Global Public Health Conferences | International Public Health Conferences
  | Singapore Public Health Congress | Singapore 2026 Public Health Confere
 nce | Singapore Public Health Conferences | Upcoming Public Health Confere
 nces | Community Health Conferences | Online Public Health Conferences | P
 ublic Health Conferences Singapore | Public Health Conference Singapore 20
 26 | Best Public Health Conferences 2026 | Public Health Research Conferen
 ces | Virtual Public Health Events | Top Public Health Events\nAttendees w
 ill benefit from keynote lectures by distinguished global experts\, intera
 ctive panel discussions\, oral and poster presentations\, and opportunitie
 s for collaborative networking and engagement. The hybrid structure ensure
 s wide accessibility for participants from all regions\, thereby enhancing
  inclusivity and expanding the conference's global reach.\nWe look forward
  to welcoming researchers\, public health professionals\, academics\, comm
 unity health workers\, and policy advocates to this impactful conference\,
  which drives forward the agenda of sustainable\, inclusive\, and evidence
 -informed public health.\n🔗 More Information: https://www.publichealthw
 orldconference.com/\n🔗 Submit Abstracts: https://www.publichealthworldc
 onference.com/abstract-submission.php\n🔗 Register Now: https://www.publ
 ichealthworldconference.com/registration.php\n📧 Contact Us: publichealt
 h@precisionglobalconferences.com\nOrganizer:\nPrecision Global Conferences
 \n📍 601 King St Ste 200 #863\, Alexandria\, VA 22314\, United States\n
 📞+1-571-5561014\n📩 publichealth@pgconferences.com
LOCATION:Village Hotel Changi\, Singapore
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/2nd-edition-of-the-public-health-world-c
 onference-phwc-2026-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
