 gto.com/events/2026/01/27/original_image66dea896-991a-4fea-90b8-e9a4841559
 0d.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Blockchain Futurist Conference is Canada’s largest and longe
 st-running Web3 and AI event\,\nnow entering its 9th edition on July 21–
 22\, 2026 in Toronto at Rebel Entertainment Complex &\nCabana Pool Bar. Co
 me join thousands of leaders\, founders\, and investors in Web3\, AI\, Cry
 pto\,\nDeFi\, RWAs\, NFTs\, DAOs\, and more.\nWhat sets the conference apa
 rt is its strong focus on networking and its unique festival-style\nvenue.
  Hosted in an immersive indoor–outdoor space with waterfront cabanas\, m
 ultiple stages\,\ntwo levels of expo booths\, and interactive activations\
 , the event is designed to bring people\ntogether. Multiple side events wi
 thin the main venue keep attendees connected and ensure\nmaximum value fro
 m every moment.\nBlockchain technology and AI are integrated throughout\, 
